{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Persistent Batch:每请求一条永久行,每步只 gather 一次",
    "subtitle": "V1 把持久状态张量直接当模型输入,join/finish 时常要整张量重排;MRV2 把「持久状态」与「本步输入」彻底分家,插入/删除变成标记一行空闲",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "output": "diagrams/vm-persistent-batch.workflow.html"
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "ln_state",
      "label": "持久状态(常驻 GPU / UVA)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ln_step",
      "label": "每步动作"
    },
    {
      "id": "ln_out",
      "label": "本步输入(临时)"
    },
    {
      "id": "ln_life",
      "label": "请求生命周期"
    },
    {
      "id": "ln_free",
      "label": "空行回收"
    }
  ],
  "phases": [
    {
      "id": "ph1",
      "label": "① 预分配与占行",
      "fromCol": 0,
      "toCol": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ph2",
      "label": "② 每步 gather",
      "fromCol": 2,
      "toCol": 3,
      "variant": "emphasis"
    },
    {
      "id": "ph3",
      "label": "③ 生命周期收尾",
      "fromCol": 4,
      "toCol": 5
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "alloc",
      "lane": "ln_state",
      "col": 0,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "预分配 max_num_reqs 行",
      "sublabel": "多数平台默认 1024",
      "icon": "database"
    },
    {
      "id": "row",
      "lane": "ln_state",
      "col": 1,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "活跃请求固定占一行",
      "sublabel": "整个生命周期不搬家",
      "icon": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "gather",
      "lane": "ln_step",
      "col": 2,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "按 idx_mapping gather",
      "sublabel": "顺序由 attention backend 决定",
      "icon": "neutral"
    },
    {
      "id": "run",
      "lane": "ln_step",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "执行 + 回写同一行",
      "sublabel": "不需要 CachedRequestState",
      "icon": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "inp",
      "lane": "ln_out",
      "col": 3,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "input_ids / positions",
      "sublabel": "query_start_loc、seq_lens",
      "icon": "database"
    },
    {
      "id": "inp2",
      "lane": "ln_out",
      "col": 4,
      "type": "database",
      "label": "block_tables 等",
      "sublabel": "纯临时,本步用完即弃",
      "icon": "database"
    },
    {
      "id": "fin",
      "lane": "ln_life",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "security",
      "label": "finish / 抢占",
      "sublabel": "当 completion 处理",
      "icon": "decision"
    },
    {
      "id": "free",
      "lane": "ln_free",
      "col": 5,
      "type": "backend",
      "label": "标记该行空闲",
      "sublabel": "零跨行搬移",
      "icon": "success"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "from": "alloc",
      "to": "row",
      "label": "行数上限 = max_num_seqs",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "from": "row",
      "to": "gather",
      "label": "取本步要算的行",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "from": "gather",
      "to": "run",
      "label": "拼出输入张量",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "from": "run",
      "to": "inp",
      "label": "本步输入来自 gather",
      "role": "main",
      "variant": "dashed"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "from": "inp",
      "to": "inp2",
      "label": "顺序可任意",
      "role": "main",
      "variant": "dashed"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "from": "run",
      "to": "fin",
      "label": "请求结束或被抢占",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "from": "fin",
      "to": "free",
      "label": "恢复时按全新请求重写",
      "role": "main"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "from": "free",
      "to": "row",
      "label": "行可被新请求占用",
      "role": "return",
      "variant": "dashed"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "alloc",
    "row",
    "gather",
    "run",
    "fin",
    "free"
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "代价:空转也占显存",
      "items": [
        "行数上限 = max_num_seqs 预分配,空行也占着",
        "all_token_ids 是 (max_num_reqs, max_model_len) int32",
        "源码注释直说「可能是几个 GB」",
        "正因为太大,MRV2 给它用 UVA 而不是 GPU 显存"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "收益:没有跨行搬移",
      "items": [
        "插入/删除 = 标记一行为空闲",
        "preemption 语义简化为「结束 + 重新开始」",
        "省掉「部分状态还在、部分已清」的中间态",
        "CachedRequestState 没有必要存在了 —— 双份真相消失"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "1024 这个默认值从哪来",
      "items": [
        "ArgUtils.get_batch_defaults:≥70 GiB 显存且非 A100 的卡,max_num_seqs 默认 1024",
        "SchedulerConfig.DEFAULT_MAX_NUM_SEQS = 128 只是 class 级兜底",
        "所以别只 grep 常量,要看按显存分档的逻辑",
        "显存账要按 (max_num_seqs × max_model_len) int32 重算"
      ]
    }
  ]
}